# .doctrine/neutrality_allow — spine logic paths ALLOWED to name a language, tool or harness, with the reason.
# <path regular expression><TAB><reason>. Reviewed: an entry without a defensible reason is a defect.
scripts/tests/spine_tests\.sh	the conformance suite exercises the packs and adapters by name; it tests them, it does not implement them
docs/tasks/artifacts/.*\.sh	probe drivers build fixtures with whatever tools the test machine has
migrations/0004-.*\.sh	migrates the pre-0.13 layout, whose canonical file was CLAUDE.md
migrations/0006-.*\.sh	detects the packs an older child already carries by their files
\.github/workflows/doctrines\.yml	bedrock's own CI installs a toolchain so the Rust pack arm runs; a child's copy inherits the step harmlessly
